trix Bloom Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_bloom_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Bloom Cited Text Quote"}}, "required": ["matrix_toulmin", "matrix_toulmin_justification", "matrix_bloom", "matrix_bloom_justification"], "title": "Step_step_logician_Response", "type": "object"}, "step_falsifier": {"properties": {"matrix_falsifier": {"description": "Falsifier: Laske 'Critical Distance Score' (1-4) aineiston perusteella.", "title": "Matrix Falsifier", "type": "integer"}, "matrix_falsifier_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Falsifier'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION.", "title": "Matrix Falsifier Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_falsifier_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Popper, K. (1963). Conjectures and Refutations: The Growth of Scientific Knowledge. (Falsification principle & Anti-Sycophancy).", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Popper, K. (1963). Conjectures and Refutations: The Growth of Scientific Knowledge. (Falsification principle & Anti-Sycophancy).'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Falsifier Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_falsifier_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, pala